    {
      "id": "u_2b3f1d5bc713c36ef14209c8_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Code Snippets are closely related to __TRILIUM_PH_0__Templates__TRILIUM_PH_1__, but instead of defining the content of an entire note, a snippet is a reusable piece of code that can easily be inserted into a __TRILIUM_PH_2__Code__TRILIUM_PH_3__ note.",
      "sourceHash": "2b3f1d5bc713c36ef14209c8aefbc1f7232b306ad1f3ca821bd1d5f7c74d53f6",
      "context": "Code Snippets",
      "contextHash": "a90f0e622e0eaec2e8d42205fdf5f1f13995901f11d6f12ff66218466edc7cc6",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_703831e9b140619a15daf999_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Creating a Code snippet__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "703831e9b140619a15daf999e4ea9f0e51742e82f0a92fa3dab0d1af17e24018",
      "context": "Code Snippets > Creating a Code snippet",
      "contextHash": "990d6a125d25832b4cf5675a79bd1c0d201f92e337427e93032f3f45432345b5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ccdcdc19e07204072271dc65_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__: ",
      "sourceHash": "ccdcdc19e07204072271dc6570b2641544647e65fde76a3fe100f17454fd3c3a",
      "context": "Code Snippets > Creating a Code snippet",
      "contextHash": "990d6a125d25832b4cf5675a79bd1c0d201f92e337427e93032f3f45432345b5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f7e9acaed05555335d7bd089_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Right-click the note where you want to place the snippet.",
      "sourceHash": "f7e9acaed05555335d7bd0898253a2f06df05eaa7dbaabc0938b20717affb314",
      "context": "Code Snippets > Creating a Code snippet",
      "contextHash": "990d6a125d25832b4cf5675a79bd1c0d201f92e337427e93032f3f45432345b5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1d0208f9b36caa96f0c967b5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Select __TRILIUM_PH_0__Insert child note__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "1d0208f9b36caa96f0c967b5e363eb933219746379cdb4eee8b99cfc1ebb37f0",
      "context": "Code Snippets > Creating a Code snippet",
      "contextHash": "990d6a125d25832b4cf5675a79bd1c0d201f92e337427e93032f3f45432345b5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c6b676833152aac9b9cc221f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Select __TRILIUM_PH_0__More__TRILIUM_PH_1__ → __TRILIUM_PH_2__Code snippet__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "c6b676833152aac9b9cc221fd98236ae241b963cfc6a4a4e15c8c087eafbdccc",
      "context": "Code Snippets > Creating a Code snippet",
      "contextHash": "990d6a125d25832b4cf5675a79bd1c0d201f92e337427e93032f3f45432345b5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_38881e1215a7162e126b27aa_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Then simply type the desired code into the note and set the correct language mode.",
      "sourceHash": "38881e1215a7162e126b27aaa7769a3a2aff2c22d78ad858ec674713f0366f25",
      "context": "Code Snippets > Creating a Code snippet",
      "contextHash": "990d6a125d25832b4cf5675a79bd1c0d201f92e337427e93032f3f45432345b5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9027c1a071465ea18f9ed900_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The note's title becomes the title of the snippet. Optionally, you can add a description in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Promoted Attributes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ section.",
      "sourceHash": "9027c1a071465ea18f9ed90016401831a23ddce6a60b61c325e8b745ca89aa87",
      "context": "Code Snippets > Creating a Code snippet",
      "contextHash": "990d6a125d25832b4cf5675a79bd1c0d201f92e337427e93032f3f45432345b5",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_073e8c8f3509d4a40ea8b322_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Inserting a snippet__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "073e8c8f3509d4a40ea8b3229b95ecaf9d7ff543c64fe6211a8e42d45544f1a0",
      "context": "Code Snippets > Inserting a snippet",
      "contextHash": "6fd06948fc2ce7e19fb3884dfa84cc6edc45336a75b11a615d4da6b0e68385db",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7399b116ff99353c2b86cf60_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To insert a snippet, type __TRILIUM_PH_0__/__TRILIUM_PH_1__ followed by the first letters of its title, then select it from the list. Typing __TRILIUM_PH_2__ lists every snippet available in the note. This also works in an included code or Markdown note that is being edited in place, see __TRILIUM_PH_3__Include Note__TRILIUM_PH_4__.",
      "sourceHash": "7399b116ff99353c2b86cf6046fb73e6ce268235c4ffe68258b46640f03edc41",
      "context": "Code Snippets > Inserting a snippet",
      "contextHash": "6fd06948fc2ce7e19fb3884dfa84cc6edc45336a75b11a615d4da6b0e68385db",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4057d6cd6ea1faeb5683de25_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Only code snippets whose language mode matches the current code note are listed. For example, a CSS code note shows only CSS snippets, not JavaScript ones. The exception is snippets set to \"Plain text\", which are available in __TRILIUM_PH_0__Markdown__TRILIUM_PH_1__ notes and any code note regardless of its language mode.",
      "sourceHash": "4057d6cd6ea1faeb5683de25c190e586daf6a5fee16675b080a75e04fa4de5ee",
      "context": "Code Snippets > Inserting a snippet",
      "contextHash": "6fd06948fc2ce7e19fb3884dfa84cc6edc45336a75b11a615d4da6b0e68385db",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Limitations__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3feba2dbd0d28887b22a99884dc255c7ff2e43988d",
      "context": "Code Snippets > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "e6c85cfae4fd09eb054e7f9ee2eb170d51b0e2e4940462a299e5061d6d71eaf3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_39f83fd3f90cb9a00659062b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Unlike __TRILIUM_PH_0__Templates__TRILIUM_PH_1__, snippets cannot be limited to a particular __TRILIUM_PH_2__workspace__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "39f83fd3f90cb9a00659062b1f9b934186425bc36ef9d1abf9c09c79c906ac4a",
      "context": "Code Snippets > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "e6c85cfae4fd09eb054e7f9ee2eb170d51b0e2e4940462a299e5061d6d71eaf3",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    }
